  "_comment": "daruda_light — light-mode counterpart of daruda_dark. §11 매핑 원칙: dark surface (l ≈ 0.10) → light surface (l ≈ 0.96), white text (l = 1.0) → near-black text (l ≈ 0.10), accents stay in the same hue but lose a few % of lightness so they hold contrast on a near-white background. Only the slots reached by Phase-3-C-migrated call sites are populated; everything else falls through to DarudaTheme::default() (i.e. the dark palette). Subsequent PRs that migrate more call sites should add the matching keys here in the same change.",

